[01:12.20]The friendship between gentlemen is as pure as water.
[01:24.81]To only see the surface is to think you hold the truth, but you're a thousand miles away.
[01:36.21]Ask me where I'll be; the answer is beyond words
[01:47.54]As spring petals bloom, in heaven glows a full moon
[02:02.56]New people bid farewell to the old year, while old people depart.
[02:11.34]Fragrant souls are always buried in desire.
[02:24.20]There are many injustices in the world.
[02:33.03]As the cycle of heavenly rebirth rolls onward
[02:37.36]Righteousness will follow.
[02:45.86]A beauty grows old, and only lament remains.
[02:53.61]To pour the pent-up emotions from my heart
[02:57.78]Let's drink together from afar.
[03:06.56]In all directions through the wild, our lost manners shall be found.
[03:15.04]The truth is hidden in between your own eyes.
[03:27.16]The Three Realms are a burning house that hides a treasure pearl.
[03:35.23]A cloudless sky stretches endlessly.
